 null, 'Mohenjo-daro, one of the largest Indus Valley Civilization cities, is located in the Sindh province of present-day Pakistan, on the banks of the Indus river.'),
('UPSC CSE (IAS)', 'General Studies Paper I', 'Ancient Indian History', 'medium', 'mcq',
