 null, 'Emperor Ashoka embraced Buddhism after witnessing the devastation of the Kalinga war, subsequently promoting non-violence (ahimsa) and Dhamma across his empire.'),
('UPSC CSE (IAS)', 'General Studies Paper I', 'Ancient Indian History', 'easy', 'mcq',
